  "description": "Discover the ultimate in convenience, performance and cutting-edge design with the Geek Vape Wenax Q Ultra Kit, a next-generation pod vape system designed for both MTL (mouth-to-lung) and RDL (restricted direct-to-lung) vapers. With its lightweight yet durable, ergonomic construction and smooth metallic-textured finish, this pod kit perfectly balances style and usability in a device you won’t want to put down. The device's Smart Interaction Technology provides astonishingly intuitive operation, enhanced further by a convenient Wrist Wake function. Designed to work seamlessly with Geek Vape’s latest generation of Q Pods, the Wenax Q Ultra supports multiple resistance options (0.4ohm, 0.6ohm, and 1.2ohm), making it compatible with a wide variety of e-liquids, including Nic Salts and 50/50 blends, and vaping styles. The pods’ leak-resistant top-fill design simplifies refilling while ensuring a mess-free experience. Whether you prefer dense RDL vapour production or crisp, intensely flavoured MTL draws, this versatile pod system has you covered. The Geek Vape Wenax Q Ultra Kit delivers a truly astonishing combination of premium performance and elegant design, not to mention truly outstanding flavour from your favourite e-liquids, making it a perfect choice for a take-anywhere, all-in-one device. Check out our vape juices and pair them perfectly with this kit. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil. How to set up the Geekvape Wenax Q Pro Pod Vape Kit",
